<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Biblica® Open Luganda Contemporary Bible 2014</book>
  <para style="h">1 Abakkolinso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebbaluwa ya Pawulo Omutukuvu ey’Olubereberye eri Abakkolinso</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Abakkolinso</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ko</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ebbaluwa ya Pawulo Omutukuvu ey’Olubereberye eri</para>
  <para style="mt1">Abakkolinso</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1"/>Nze Pawulo eyayitibwa okuba omutume wa Yesu Kristo olw’okwagala kwa Katonda, ne Sossene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sossene </char><char style="ft" closed="false">alabika okuba nga ye mukulembeze w’ekkuŋŋaaniro ayogerwako mu <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 18:17">Bik 18:17</ref></char></char></note> owooluganda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">owooluganda kitegeeza mukkiriza munnange</char></note>, <verse eid="1CO 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2"/>tuwandiikira ekkanisa ya Katonda eri mu Kkolinso n’eri abo abaatukuzibwa mu Kristo Yesu, abayitibwa abatukuvu, n’abo bonna abakoowoola erinnya lya Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo mu buli kifo, owaabwe era owaffe; <verse eid="1CO 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3"/>ekisa kibe ku mmwe n’emirembe egiva eri Katonda Kitaffe ne Mukama waffe Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwebaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4"/>Nneebaza Katonda wange bulijjo ku lwammwe, olw’ekisa kya Katonda ekyabaweebwa mu Kristo Yesu, <verse eid="1CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5"/>mu ye mwagaggawazibwa mu buli kintu, ne mu kwogera kwonna, era ne mu kutegeera kwonna, <verse eid="1CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6"/>era ng’obujulirwa bwa Kristo bwe bwakakasibwa mu mmwe, <verse eid="1CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7"/>muleme kubaako kye mwetaaga mu kirabo kyonna, nga mulindirira okubikkulirwa kwa Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8"/>Era oyo y’alibanyweza ku nkomerero, nga temuliiko kya kunenyezebwa ku lunaku lwa Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9"/>Katonda mwesigwa, oyo eyabayita mu kussekimu okw’Omwana we Yesu Kristo Mukama waffe.<verse eid="1CO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10"/>Kaakano mbeegayirira abooluganda, mu Iinnya lya Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo, mukkiriziganyenga mwekka na mwekka muleme okwawukananga. Naye mube n’omutima gumu n’endowooza emu. <verse eid="1CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11"/>Abooluganda, ab’ewa Kuloowe bannyinnyonnyola nti mu mmwe mulimu ennyombo. <verse eid="1CO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12"/>Kye ŋŋamba kye kino nti buli omu ku mmwe agamba nti nze ndi wa Pawulo, nze ndi wa Apolo, nze ndi wa Keefa, nze ndi wa Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13"/>Kale Kristo ayawuliddwamu? Pawulo yakomererwa ku musaalaba ku lwammwe? Oba mwabatizibwa mu linnya lya Pawulo? <verse eid="1CO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14"/>Neebaza Katonda kubanga nze sibatizanga muntu n’omu ku mmwe okuggyako Kulisupo ne Gaayo. <verse eid="1CO 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15"/>Noolwekyo si kulwa nga wabaawo agamba nti mwabatizibwa mu linnya lyange. <verse eid="1CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16"/>Naye nzijukira nga nabatiza ab’omu nnyumba ya Suteefana, naye sirowooza nga nabatiza omuntu omulala yenna. <verse eid="1CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17"/>Kristo teyantuma kubatiza wabula yantuma kubuulira Njiri. Era sigibuulira mu magezi ga bigambo bugambo, si kulwa ng’omusaalaba gwa Kristo gumalibwamu amaanyi gaagwo.<verse eid="1CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo Amagezi n’Amaanyi ga Katonda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18"/>Ekigambo ky’omusaalaba kya busirusiru eri abo abazikirira naye eri ffe abaalokolebwa ge maanyi ga Katonda. <verse eid="1CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19"/>Kubanga kyawandiikibwa nti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">“Ndizikiriza amagezi g’abagezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 1:19">ne nzigyawo okumanya kw’abayivu.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20"/>Kale omugezi aluwa? N’omuwandiisi aluwa? Omuwakanyi w’omulembe guno aluwa? Katonda teyafuula amagezi ag’ensi eno okuba obusirusiru? <verse eid="1CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21"/>Kubanga Katonda, mu magezi ge, yalaba ng’ensi teyinza kumumanya ng’eyita mu kutegeera kwayo. Katonda kyeyava asiima okuyita mu busirusiru bw’okubuulira Enjiri okulokola abakkiriza. <verse eid="1CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22"/>Kubanga Abayudaaya banoonya bubonero, Abayonaani bo ne banoonya amagezi, <verse eid="1CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23"/>naye ffe tubuulira Kristo eyakomererwa. Eri Abayudaaya nkonge, eri Abaamawanga busirusiru, <verse eid="1CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24"/>naye eri abaayitibwa, Abayudaaya n’Abamawanga, Kristo ge maanyi ga Katonda, era amagezi ga Katonda. <verse eid="1CO 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25"/>Kubanga obusirusiru bwa Katonda businga amagezi g’abantu, n’obunafu bwa Katonda businga abantu amaanyi.<verse eid="1CO 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26"/>Kubanga mulabe okuyitibwa kwammwe abooluganda, bangi ku mmwe temwali bagezi mu mubiri, era nga bangi temuli b’amaanyi, era nga bangi temwazaalibwa nga muli ba kitiibwa. <verse eid="1CO 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27"/>Naye Katonda yalonda ebisirusiru eby’ensi, akwase abagezi ensonyi; era Katonda yalonda ebinafu eby’ensi, akwase ab’amaanyi ensonyi, <verse eid="1CO 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28"/>era n’alonda abakopi ab’ensi n’abo abanyoomebwa; era n’ebitaliiwo alyoke aggyewo ebiriwo, <verse eid="1CO 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29"/>waleme kubaawo muntu n’omu eyeenyumiriza mu maaso ga Katonda. <verse eid="1CO 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30"/>Kyokka ku bw’oyo muli mu Kristo Yesu, eyafuuka amagezi gye tuli okuva eri Katonda, bwe butuukirivu, n’okutukuzibwa, n’okununulibwa, <verse eid="1CO 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31"/>nga bwe kyawandiikibwa nti eyeenyumiriza yeenyumirizenga mu Mukama waffe.<verse eid="1CO 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1"/>Bwe najja gye muli abooluganda sajja gye muli na bumanyirivu mu kwogera wadde amagezi nga nangirira ekyama kya Katonda gye muli. <verse eid="1CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2"/>Kubanga nasalawo obutamanya kintu kyonna mu mmwe wabula Yesu Kristo oyo eyakomererwa. <verse eid="1CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3"/>Bwe nnali nammwe nnali munafu, nga ntya era nga nkankana nnyo. <verse eid="1CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4"/>Era okubuulira kwange n’okuyigiriza tebyali mu bigambo bya magezi ebisendasenda, naye byali mu maanyi ne Mwoyo Mutukuvu, <verse eid="1CO 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5"/>okukkiriza kwammwe kuleme kuba kw’amagezi ga bantu wabula kwesigame ku maanyi ga Katonda.<verse eid="1CO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amagezi ga Katonda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6"/>Naye eri abo abakulu mu mwoyo, twogera eby’amagezi agatali ga mu mulembe guno, wadde ag’abafuzi ab’omu mulembe guno abaggwaawo. <verse eid="1CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7"/>Wabula twogera eby’amagezi ga Katonda, agatamanyiddwa era agakisibwa, Katonda bye yateekateeka edda n’edda olw’ekitiibwa kyaffe; <verse eid="1CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8"/>tewali n’omu ku bafuzi ab’omulembe guno abaagategeera, kubanga singa baamanya tebandikomeredde Mukama ow’ekitiibwa. <verse eid="1CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9"/>Naye nga bwe kyawandiikibwa nti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">“Eriiso bye litalabangako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">n’okutu bye kutawulirangako,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">n’omutima gw’omuntu kye gutalowoozangako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">Katonda bye yategekera abo abamwagala.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10"/>Naye ffe Katonda yabitubikkulira mu Mwoyo, kubanga Omwoyo anoonyereza ebintu byonna, n’eby’omunda ennyo ebya Katonda. <verse eid="1CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11"/>Kubanga muntu ki ategeera eby’omuntu omulala okuggyako omwoyo w’omuntu oyo ali mu ffe? Noolwekyo n’ebintu bya Katonda tewali abimanyi okuggyako Omwoyo wa Katonda. <verse eid="1CO 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12"/>Era kaakano ffe tetwafuna mwoyo wa ku nsi, wabula Omwoyo eyava eri Katonda, tulyoke tumanye ebintu Katonda bye yatuwa obuwa, <verse eid="1CO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13"/>era ne mu bigambo bye twogera so si mu kuyigirizibwa okw’amagezi g’abantu, naye mu bigambo Omwoyo by’ayigiriza, ebintu eby’Omwoyo nga bikwatagana n’eby’Omwoyo. <verse eid="1CO 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14"/>Omuntu obuntu tasobola kufuna bintu bya Mwoyo wa Katonda, kubanga busirusiru gy’ali, era tasobola kubimanya, kubanga bikeberwa Mwoyo. <verse eid="1CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15"/>Naye omuntu ow’Omwoyo akebera ebintu byonna, naye tewali n’omu amukebera.<verse eid="1CO 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16"/>“Kubanga ani eyali ategedde okulowooza kwa Mukama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">era ani alimulagira?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Kyokka ffe tulina endowooza ya Kristo.”<verse eid="1CO 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Okwawukana mu Kkanisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1"/>Nange abooluganda ssaasobola kwogera nammwe ng’ab’omwoyo, naye nayogera nammwe ng’ab’omubiri era ng’abaana abawere mu Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2"/>Nabanywesa mata so si mmere enkalubo, kubanga mwali temunnagisobola. Naye era ne kaakano temunnagisobola, <verse eid="1CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3"/>kubanga mukyafugibwa mubiri. Naye obanga mukyalimu obuggya n’ennyombo, temufugibwa mubiri era temutambula ng’abalina empisa z’abantu obuntu? <verse eid="1CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4"/>Kubanga omuntu yenna bw’agamba nti, “Nze ndi wa Pawulo,” n’omulala nti, “Nze ndi wa Apolo,” olwo temuba ng’abantu obuntu?<verse eid="1CO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5"/>Kale Apolo ye ani? Ne Pawulo ye ani? Baweereza buweereza ababakkirizisa, nga Mukama bwe yawa buli omu. <verse eid="1CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6"/>Nze nasiga, Apolo n’afukirira, kyokka Katonda ye yakuza. <verse eid="1CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7"/>Kale bwe kityo oyo asiga n’oyo afukirira si be bakulu wabula Katonda akuza. <verse eid="1CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8"/>Oyo asiga kaakano n’oyo afukirira bali bumu, era buli omu aliweebwa empeera ye okusinziira ku mulimu gw’aliba akoze. <verse eid="1CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9"/>Kubanga ffe tuli bakozi abakolera awamu ne Katonda, ate mmwe muli nnimiro ya Katonda, muli nnyumba ya Katonda.<verse eid="1CO 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10"/>Okusinziira ku kisa kya Katonda ekya mpeebwa, ng’omuzimbi ow’amagezi, nazimba omusingi, kaakano omulala aguzimbako. Naye buli aguzimbako yeegenderezenga bw’aguzimbako. <verse eid="1CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11"/>Kubanga tewali n’omu ayinza kuteekawo musingi mulala okuggyako ogwo ogwateekebwawo, ye Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12"/>Naye Omuntu bw’aguzimbisaako ezaabu, effeeza, n’amayinja ag’omuwendo n’emiti, n’essubi, oba ebisasiro; <verse eid="1CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13"/>omulimu gwa buli omu gulirabibwa, kubanga omuliro guligwolesa ku lunaku olwo, era omuliro ogwo gwe gulyoreka omulimu gwa buli omu nga bwe guli. <verse eid="1CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14"/>Omuntu kye yazimba ku musingi ogwo bwe kirisigalawo, aliweebwa empeera. <verse eid="1CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15"/>Naye omulimu gw’omuntu yenna bwe gulyokebwa omuliro, alifiirwa, kyokka ye yennyini alirokolebwa, naye ng’ayita mu muliro.<verse eid="1CO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16"/>Temumanyi nti mmwe muli yeekaalu ya Katonda era nga Omwoyo wa Katonda abeera mu mmwe? <verse eid="1CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17"/>Omuntu yenna azikiriza Yeekaalu ya Katonda, Katonda alizikiriza omuntu oyo; kubanga Yeekaalu ya Katonda ntukuvu, ye mmwe.<verse eid="1CO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18"/>Omuntu yenna teyeerimbalimbanga; omuntu yenna bwe yeerowoozanga okuba omugezi mu mmwe mu mirembe gino afuukenga musirusiru alyoke abeere omugezi. <verse eid="1CO 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19"/>Kubanga amagezi ag’ensi eno, bwe busirusiru eri Katonda. Kubanga kyawandiikibwa nti, “Akwatira abagezi mu nkwe zaabwe.” <verse eid="1CO 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20"/>Era kyawandiikibwa nti, “Mukama amanyi ng’ebirowoozo by’abagezi temuli nsa.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21"/>Noolwekyo waleme kubaawo muntu n’omu yeenyumiririza mu bantu, kubanga byonna byammwe, <verse eid="1CO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22"/>oba Pawulo oba Apolo oba Keefa oba nsi, oba bulamu, oba kufa, oba bintu ebya kaakano, oba ebijja, byonna byammwe, <verse eid="1CO 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23"/>nammwe muli ba Kristo, ne Kristo wa Katonda.<verse eid="1CO 3:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Abatume ba Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1"/>Omuntu asaanidde atulabe ng’abaweereza ba Kristo era abawanika b’ebyama bya Katonda. <verse eid="1CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2"/>Ate era omuwanika kimugwanira okuba omuntu omwesigwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3"/>Naye gye ndi ekyo kintu kitono nnyo mmwe okunsalira omusango oba omuntu yenna ku lunaku olw’okusalirako omusango; nange sseesalira musango. <verse eid="1CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4"/>Kubanga nze seemanyiiko nsonga yonna, wabula ekyo tekimpeesa butuukirivu, naye ansalira omusango ye Mukama waffe. <verse eid="1CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5"/>Noolwekyo temusalanga musango ekiseera nga tekinnatuuka okutuusa Mukama waffe lw’alijja, alimulisa ebyakwekebwa eby’ekizikiza, n’ayolesa n’ebigendererwa by’omutima, buli muntu n’alyoka atendebwa Katonda.<verse eid="1CO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6"/>Kaakano abooluganda ebintu ebyo mbigeredde ku nze ne ku Apolo ku lwammwe, mulyoke muyigire ku ffe obutasukkanga ku byawandiikibwa, omuntu omu alemenga okwegulumiza ng’anyooma omulala. <verse eid="1CO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7"/>Kubanga ani akwawula? Era mulina kye mutaaweebwa? Kale obanga ddala mwaweebwa, kiki ate ekibenyumirizisa ng’abataakifuna? <verse eid="1CO 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8"/>Mwakkuta dda n’okugaggawala ne mugaggawala, era ne mufuuka bakabaka awatali ffe; naye nandyagadde mufuuke bakabaka, naffe tulyoke tufuukire wamu bakabaka nammwe. <verse eid="1CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9"/>Kubanga ndowooza nga ffe abatume, Katonda yatuteeka ku nkomerero ng’abasibe abalindirira okuttibwa, kubanga twafuulibwa ekyerolerwa eri ensi, eri bamalayika n’eri abantu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10"/>Tuli basirusiru ku bwa Kristo, naye mmwe muli bagezi mu Kristo; Ffe tuli banafu naye mmwe muli ba maanyi! Mmwe muli ba kitiibwa naye ffe tunyoomebwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11"/>Era ne mu kiseera kino tulumwa enjala n’ennyonta nga tetulina na kyakwambala, tukubibwa era tubungeeta bubungeesi. <verse eid="1CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12"/>Tutegana nga tukola emirimu n’emikono gyaffe; tusabira emikisa abo abatukolimira; bwe tuyigganyizibwa tugumiikiriza; <verse eid="1CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13"/>abo abatuvuma tubaddamu ne gonjebwa. Era n’okutuusa kaakano tuli ng’ebisooto mu bigere era tuli ng’ebisaaniiko.<verse eid="1CO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14"/>Siwandiika bintu bino lwa kubaswaza naye lwa kubabuulirira ng’abaana bange abaagalwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15"/>Kubanga newaakubadde mulina abalala nkumi na nkumi ababayigiriza ebya Kristo, naye mujjukirenga nga mulina bakitammwe batono. Kubanga nze mbazaala mu Kristo olw’enjiri. <verse eid="1CO 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16"/>Noolwekyo mbongeramu amaanyi mulabire ku nze. <verse eid="1CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17"/>Kyennava mbatumira Timoseewo omwana wange omwesigwa era omwagalwa mu Mukama waffe, anaabajjukizanga ebyo bye ngoberera mu Kristo Yesu nga bwe njigiriza wonna wonna mu buli Kkanisa.<verse eid="1CO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18"/>Naye waliwo abamu mu mmwe abeekuluntaza nga balowooza nti sigenda kujja gye muli. <verse eid="1CO 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19"/>Naye nzija mangu, Mukama bw’anaasiima ndyoke mmanye amaanyi g’abo abeekuluntaza so si mu bigambo obugambo. <verse eid="1CO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20"/>Kubanga obwakabaka bwa Katonda tebuli mu kwogera bwogezi, wabula mu maanyi. <verse eid="1CO 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21"/>Kiruwa kye mwagala? Nzije n’omuggo, oba nzije na kwagala n’omwoyo ogw’obuwombeefu?<verse eid="1CO 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Okugoba Owooluganda ow’Empisa Embi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1"/>Twategeezebwa nga mu mmwe mulimu obwenzi, ate obwenzi obutali na mu baamawanga, kubanga omuntu atwala muka kitaawe n’amufuula mukazi we. <verse eid="1CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2"/>Mwekuluntazizza mu kifo ky’okwewombeeka. Oyo akola ekikolwa ng’ekyo eky’okwekuluntaza, tasaanye kuggyibwamu mu mmwe? <verse eid="1CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3"/>Nze newaakubadde nga siri eyo nammwe mu mubiri, naye nga bwe ndi nammwe mu mwoyo, omuntu eyakola ekyo mmaze okumusalira omusango okumusinga. <verse eid="1CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4"/>Mu linnya lya Mukama waffe Yesu, mukuŋŋaane nga nange ndi nammwe mu mwoyo n’amaanyi ga Mukama waffe Yesu nga gali nammwe. <verse eid="1CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5"/>Omuntu ng’oyo mumuweeyo eri Setaani omubiri gwe guzikirizibwe, omwoyo gwe gulyoke gulokolebwe ku lunaku lwa Mukama waffe.<verse eid="1CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6"/>Okwenyumiriza kwammwe si kulungi. Temumanyi ng’ekizimbulukusa ekitono kizimbulukusa ekitole kyonna? <verse eid="1CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7"/>Muggyeemu ekizimbulukusa eky’edda, mulyoke mubeere ekitole ekiggya, nga temuliimu kizimbulukusa; kubanga Kristo ye ndiga eyaweebwayo ng’ekiweebwayo eky’Okuyitako ku lwaffe. <verse eid="1CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8"/>Noolwekyo tulye embaga si na kizimbulukusa eky’edda, newaakubadde ekizimbulukusa eky’ettima n’ekibi, naye tugirye n’omugaati ogutaliimu kizimbulukusa nga gulimu obulongoofu n’amazima.<verse eid="1CO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9"/>Mbawandiikira nga mbalabula obutegattanga na benzi, <verse eid="1CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10"/>so si okwewala abenzi ab’ensi eno, oba aboomululu, oba abakumpanya, oba abasinza bakatonda abalala, kubanga kyandibagwanidde mmwe okuva mu nsi. <verse eid="1CO 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11"/>Naye kaakano mbawandiikira nga mbategeeza nti mwewale omuntu yenna ayitibwa owooluganda ng’ate mwenzi, owoomululu, asinza bakatonda abalala, oba omuvumi, oba omutamiivu oba omukumpanya. Ab’engeri eyo n’okulya temulyanga nabo.<verse eid="1CO 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12"/>Kale nze nfaayo ki okusalira ab’ebweru omusango? Lwaki sisalira abo abali mu mmwe? <verse eid="1CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13"/>Naye ab’ebweru Katonda ye abasalira. Omubi oyo ali mu mmwe mumuggyeemu.<verse eid="1CO 5:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1"/>Omuntu yenna mu mmwe bw’aba n’ensonga ne munne, agitwala eri abatali batuukirivu oba eri abatukuvu? <verse eid="1CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2"/>Oba temumanyi ng’abatukuvu be balisalira ensi omusango? Kale obanga mmwe mulisalira ensi omusango, temusobola kusala nsonga ntono eziri mu mmwe? <verse eid="1CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3"/>Temumanyi nga ffe tulisalira bamalayika omusango, okwo nga totaddeeko bintu bya mu bulamu buno? <verse eid="1CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4"/>Kale bwe muba n’ensonga lwaki muzitwala mu abo abanyoomebwa ekkanisa ne mubalonda okuba abalamuzi? <verse eid="1CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5"/>Njagala kubakwasa nsonyi; ddala mu mmwe temuli muntu n’omu alina magezi asobola okusala ensonga wakati w’abooluganda? <verse eid="1CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6"/>Naye owooluganda ayinza okuwoza n’owooluganda mu maaso g’abatali bakkiriza?<verse eid="1CO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7"/>N’okuwozaŋŋana mwekka na mwekka kiraga nti muli mu kabi. Lwaki obutamala gakolwanga bubi? Lwaki obutamala galyazaamaanyizibwanga? <verse eid="1CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8"/>Naye musobya baganda bammwe ne mubalyazaamaanya. <verse eid="1CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9"/>Oba temumanyi ng’abatali batuukirivu tebaliyingira mu bwakabaka bwa Katonda? Temulimbibwanga. Abakaba, newaakubadde abasinza bakatonda abalala, newaakubadde abenzi, newaakubadde abasajja abeeyisa ng’abakazi, newaakubadde abalya ebisiyaga,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bamalaaya abasajja n’abasajja abaalyanga ebisiyaga baali bangi mu nsi ya Buyonaani ne mu Baruumi</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10"/>newaakubadde ababbi, newaakubadde aboomululu, newaakubadde abatamiivu, newaakubadde abajerega, newaakubadde abanyazi tebaliyingira mu bwakabaka bwa Katonda. <verse eid="1CO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11"/>Era abamu ku mmwe mwali nga bo, naye ebibi byammwe byanaazibwa era mwatukuzibwa era mwaweebwa obutuukirivu mu linnya lya Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo n’Omwoyo wa Katonda waffe.<verse eid="1CO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekibi eky’Obwenzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12"/>Ebintu byonna nzikirizibwa okubikola, mu mateeka, naye byonna tebinsanira. Ebintu byonna nzikirizibwa okubikola naye sigenda kufugibwa kintu na kimu. <verse eid="1CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13"/>Ebyokulya bya lubuto, n’olubuto lwa byakulya. Naye byombi Katonda alibizikiriza. Omubiri si gwa bwenzi, naye gwa Mukama. <verse eid="1CO 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14"/>Era Katonda eyazuukiza Mukama waffe alituzuukiza olw’amaanyi ge. <verse eid="1CO 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15"/>Temumanyi ng’emibiri gyammwe bitundu bya Kristo? Ate nzirire ebitundu bya Kristo mbifuule eby’omwenzi? Kikafuuwe. <verse eid="1CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16"/>Oba temumanyi nti omuntu yenna eyeegatta n’omwenzi, emibiri gyammwe gifuuka gumu? Kubanga kigambibwa nti, “Bombi balifuuka omubiri gumu.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17"/>Naye eyeegatta ne Mukama waffe bafuuka omu mu mwoyo.<verse eid="1CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18"/>Mudduke obwenzi. Buli kibi omuntu ky’akola kiba ku mubiri, naye ayenda akola ekibi ku mubiri gwe ye yennyini. <verse eid="1CO 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19"/>Oba temumanyi ng’omubiri gwammwe ye Yeekaalu ya Mwoyo Mutukuvu Katonda gwe yabawa, era n’emibiri gyammwe si gyammwe ku bwammwe? <verse eid="1CO 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20"/>Kubanga mwagulibwa na muwendo, noolwekyo emibiri gyammwe gigulumizenga Katonda.<verse eid="1CO 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Obufumbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1"/>Kaakano ku bintu bye mwampandiikira, kirungi omusajja obutakwatanga ku mukazi. <verse eid="1CO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2"/>Naye olw’ebikolwa eby’obwenzi, buli musajja abeerenga ne mukazi we; era na buli mukazi abeerenga ne bba. <verse eid="1CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3"/>Omusajja ateekwa okutuukirizanga eby’obufumbo byonna eri mukazi we era n’omukazi bw’atyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4"/>Kubanga omukazi bw’afumbirwa aba takyafuga mubiri gwe ye wabula bba, era n’omusajja bw’atyo aba takyafuga mubiri gwe ye wabula mukazi we y’aba agulinako obuyinza. <verse eid="1CO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5"/>Buli omu alemenga okumma munne wabula nga mulagaanye ekiseera mulyoke mufune ebbanga ery’okusabiramu n’oluvannyuma muddiŋŋanenga, Setaani aleme okubasuula olw’obuteefuga bwammwe. <verse eid="1CO 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6"/>Naye kino nkyogera mu ngeri ya kukkiriziganya so si mu ngeri ya kuwa kiragiro. <verse eid="1CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7"/>Nandyagadde buli omu abeere nga nze; naye buli muntu alina ekirabo ekikye ku bubwe ekiva eri Katonda, omu mu ngeri emu n’omulala mu ngeri endala.<verse eid="1CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8"/>Naye njogera eri abo abatannawasa ne bannamwandu; kirungi okusigala nga bwe bali, era nga nze bwe ndi. <verse eid="1CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9"/>Naye bwe baba tebasobola kwefuga bafumbirwe, oba bawase, kubanga okufumbiriganwa kisinga okwakiriranga okw’okwegomba.<verse eid="1CO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10"/>Naye abafumbo mbawa etteeka eriva eri Mukama waffe: omukazi tanobanga ku bba. <verse eid="1CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11"/>Singa baawukana, omukazi ateekwa kubeerera awo, oba si ekyo addeyo ewa bba basonyiwagane; n’omusajja tagobanga mukazi we.<verse eid="1CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12"/>Abalala njogera gye bali kubanga si tteeka eriva eri Mukama waffe, naye mbagamba nti owooluganda bw’abeera n’omukazi atali mukkiriza ng’ayagala okubeera naye, tamugobanga. <verse eid="1CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13"/>Era omukazi omukkiriza alina bba atali mukkiriza naye ng’amwagala, tamuvangako. <verse eid="1CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14"/>Kubanga omusajja atali mukkiriza ayinza okufuulibwa omukkiriza ng’ayambibwa mukyala we omukkiriza, oba omukyala atali mukkiriza ayinza okufuulibwa omukkiriza ng’ayambibwa bba omukkiriza. Kubanga bwe kitaba ekyo abaana bammwe banditwaliddwa ng’abatali balongoofu naye ku lw’ekyo abaana bammwe baba balongoofu. <verse eid="1CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15"/>Kyokka oyo atali mukkiriza bw’ayagala okwawukana, baawukane; mu nsonga eyo omusajja omukkiriza oba omukyala taasibwenga mu ekyo, kubanga Katonda ayagala abaana be okubeera n’eddembe. <verse eid="1CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16"/>Ggwe omukazi omukkiriza omanyi otya ng’olirokola balo? Oba ggwe omusajja omukkiriza omanyi otya ng’olirokola mukazi wo?<verse eid="1CO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17"/>Buli omu abeere mu bulamu Mukama bwe yamuwa, era Katonda mwe yamuyitira mw’abatambuliranga. Ekyo ky’ekiragiro kye mpa ekkanisa zonna. <verse eid="1CO 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18"/>Eyayitibwa ng’amaze okukomolebwa aleme kugamba nti ssinga teyakomolebwa, n’oyo eyakkiriza nga si mukomole aleme kufaayo ku kukomolebwa. <verse eid="1CO 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19"/>Kubanga okukomolebwa si kintu era obutakomolebwa si kintu, wabula ekikulu kwe kukwata amateeka ga Katonda. <verse eid="1CO 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20"/>Buli omu abeerenga mu kuyitibwa Katonda kwe yamuyitiramu. <verse eid="1CO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21"/>Oba nga wayitibwa ng’oli muddu ekyo kireme okuba ekikulu; naye bw’oba ng’ofunye omukisa okufuuka ow’eddembe, gukozese. <verse eid="1CO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22"/>Kubanga eyayitibwa Mukama nga muddu, Mukama yamufuula wa ddembe, n’oyo eyali ow’eddembe yafuuka muddu wa Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23"/>Mwagulibwa na muwendo noolwekyo temufuukanga baddu ba bantu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24"/>Kale abooluganda, buli kifo kyonna omuntu yenna ky’alimu, mwe yayitirwa abeere mu ekyo.<verse eid="1CO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abatali Bafumbo ne Bannamwandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25"/>Naye ku ky’abatafumbirwanga wadde okuwasa, sirina kiragiro kiva eri Mukama wabula Mukama mu kusaasira kwe yampa amagezi agayinza okwesigibwa kwe nnaasinziira okubawa ekirowoozo kyange. <verse eid="1CO 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26"/>Kino nkirowooza nga kirungi, olw’embeera eya kaakano, nga kirungi omuntu okusigala nga bw’ali. <verse eid="1CO 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27"/>Obanga oli mufumbo tosaanye kwawukana na munno. Naye obanga wayawukana n’omukazi, tonoonya wa kuwasa. <verse eid="1CO 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28"/>Kyokka omusajja bw’awasa aba tayonoonye, era n’embeerera bw’afumbirwa naye aba tayonoonye. Wabula abafumbo, obufumbo bujja kubaleetera emitawaana gye nandiyagadde mwewale.<verse eid="1CO 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29"/>Naye kino kye mbategeeza abooluganda nti ekiseera kiyimpawadde. Noolwekyo abo abalina abakazi babe ng’abatabalina. <verse eid="1CO 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30"/>N’abo abakaaba babe ng’abatakaaba, n’abo abasanyuka babe ng’abatasanyuka. N’abo abagula ebintu babe ng’abatalina kintu kye bayita kyabwe. <verse eid="1CO 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31"/>Era n’abo abakozesa eby’oku nsi kuno bireme okubamalamu ennyo, kubanga ensi eya kaakano eggwaawo.<verse eid="1CO 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32"/>Naye kye mbagaliza mmwe bwe buteraliikirira. Omusajja atali mufumbo yeemalira ku bya Mukama, engeri gy’asanyusa Mukama. <verse eid="1CO 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33"/>Naye omufumbo yeeraliikirira bya nsi, nga bw’anaasanyusa mukazi we; <verse eid="1CO 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34"/>aba yeesazeemu, ng’atta aga n’aga. N’omukazi atali mufumbo n’embeerera bafaayo ku bintu bya Mukama, babeerenga batukuvu mu mubiri ne mu mwoyo. Naye omukazi omufumbo yeeraliikirira bya mu nsi, engeri gy’anaasanyusaamu bba. <verse eid="1CO 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35"/>Bino mbyogera olw’okubagasa, so si kubaziyiza kuwasa na kufumbirwa. Kubanga njagala musobole okuweereza Mukama nga tewali birala bibaziyiza okweweerayo ddala.<verse eid="1CO 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36"/>Omusajja bw’alowooza nti aba teyeeyisizza bulungi eri omuwala oyo gw’ayogereza bw’atamuwasa, bwe bafumbiriganwa, aba tayonoonye. <verse eid="1CO 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37"/>Naye oyo asobola okwefuga ng’alina omutima omunywevu, n’asalawo awatali kuwalirizibwa nti omuwala tajja kumuwasa, aba asazeewo bulungi. <verse eid="1CO 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38"/>Kale oyo awasa omuwala gw’ayogereza aba akoze bulungi, naye oyo atamuwasa y’aba asinze okukola obulungi.<verse eid="1CO 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39"/>Omukazi omufumbo abeera kitundu kya bba, bba bw’aba akyali mulamu. Naye bba bw’afa olwo ayinza okufumbirwa omusajja omulala gw’ayagala, kyokka omusajja oyo ateekwa kuba mu Mukama waffe yekka. <verse eid="1CO 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40"/>Naye nze ndowooza nti alina omukisa oyo singa taddayo kufumbirwa. Era ndowooza nga nange nnina Omwoyo wa Katonda.<verse eid="1CO 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Ebiweereddwayo eri Bakatonda Abalala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1"/>Kale ku nsonga ey’okuwaayo ssaddaaka eri bakatonda abalala: tumanyi nti byonna tubitegeera. Naye okwerowooza nti tumanyi kuleeta okwekuluntaza naye okwagala kuzimba. <verse eid="1CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2"/>Omuntu alowooza nti amanyi, aba alaga nga bw’atannamanya era nga bwe kimugwanira okumanya. <verse eid="1CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3"/>Naye oyo ayagala Katonda amanyibwa Katonda.<verse eid="1CO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4"/>Kale ku nsonga eno ey’okulya ebiweereddwayo eri bakatonda abalala, tumanyi bakatonda abalala bwe bataliimu nsa. Era tumanyi nga waliwo Katonda omu yekka, tewali mulala. <verse eid="1CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5"/>Waliwo abayitibwa bakatonda abali mu ggulu ne ku nsi newaakubadde nga waliwo bakatonda bangi n’abaami bangi. <verse eid="1CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6"/>Kyokka ffe tumanyi nga waliwo Katonda omu yekka, ye Kitaffe, era ye yatonda ebintu byonna, era naffe tuli mu ye, era nga waliwo Mukama omu ye Yesu Kristo, ebintu byonna mwe byayita okutondebwa, era mu ye mwe tuyita okufuna obulamu.<verse eid="1CO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7"/>Kyokka kino abamu tebakimanyi. Obulamu bwabwe bwonna bwamanyiira okulowooza nti bakatonda abalala balamu ddala, era nga n’ebiweebwayo ebyo biweebwayo eri bakatonda ddala. Kaakano bwe balya emmere eyo eyonoona emyoyo gyabwe, kuba minafu, beeyonoona bokka. <verse eid="1CO 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8"/>Naye emmere si yeetuleetera okusiimibwa Katonda. Bwe tutagirya tewaba kye tusubwa, era ne bwe tugirya terina kye twongerako.<verse eid="1CO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9"/>Kyokka mwegendereze bwe muba mukozesa eddembe lyabwe eryo, si kulwa nga mwesittaza abo abanafu mu kukkiriza. <verse eid="1CO 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10"/>Kubanga ggwe amanyi, singa omunafu mu kukkiriza akulaba ng’olya mu ssabo lya bakatonda abalala, ekyo tekirimugumya okulya ebiweereddwayo eri bakatonda abalala. <verse eid="1CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11"/>Kale owooluganda oyo omunafu, Kristo gwe yafiirira, azikirizibwe olw’okumanya kwo! <verse eid="1CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12"/>Noolwekyo bwe mukola ekibi ku booluganda muba muleeta ekiwundu ku mwoyo gwabwe kubanga banafu, era muba mukola kibi eri Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13"/>Kale obanga kye ndya kyesittaza muganda wange, siryenga nnyama emirembe gyonna, nnemenga okwesittaza muganda wange.<verse eid="1CO 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Ebigwanira Omutume ne by’Ateekwa Okukola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1"/>Ssiri wa ddembe? Ssiri mutume? Ssaalaba Yesu Mukama waffe? Si mmwe bibala by’omulimu gwange mu Mukama waffe? <verse eid="1CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2"/>Obanga ssiri mutume eri abalala, naye ndi mutume eri mmwe, kubanga mmwe kabonero k’obutume bwange mu Mukama waffe.<verse eid="1CO 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3"/>Ekyo ky’eky’okuwoza kyange eri abo abambulirizaako. <verse eid="1CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4"/>Sirina buyinza kulya na kunywa? <verse eid="1CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5"/>Singa nnewasiza omukazi, siyinza kutambula naye mu ŋŋendo zange ng’abatume abalala ne Keefa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Keefa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ye Peetero</char></note>, ne baganda ba Mukama waffe bwe bakola? <verse eid="1CO 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6"/>Oba Balunabba nange, ffe ffekka ffe tusaana okwekolera?<verse eid="1CO 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7"/>Muserikale ki ali mu magye nga yeesasula empeera? Muntu ki eyalima ennimiro y’emizabbibu naye n’aziyizibwa okulya ku bibala byayo? Oba ani alunda ekisibo n’atanywa ku mata gaamu? <verse eid="1CO 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8"/>Ebyo mbyogera ku bwange ng’omuntu, etteeka nalyo si bwe ligamba? <verse eid="1CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9"/>Kubanga kyawandiikibwa mu mateeka ga Musa nti, “Tosibanga mumwa gwa nte ewuula eŋŋaano,” Mulowooza Katonda afa ku bya nte zokka, <verse eid="1CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10"/>oba kino akyogera ku lwaffe? Kubanga kino kyawandiikibwa ku lwaffe, oyo alima mu kusuubira alime, n’oyo awuula asuubire okufuna ku bibala. <verse eid="1CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11"/>Obanga ffe twabasigamu eby’omwoyo, tekiriba kya kitalo bwe tulikungula ebyammwe eby’omubiri? <verse eid="1CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12"/>Kale obanga abalala balina obuyinza ku mmwe, ffe tetusaanidde nnyo n’okusingawo? Kyokka ffe tetwabakaka kubituwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Naye tugumiikiriza byonna, tuleme okuziyiza Enjiri ya Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13"/>Temumanyi ng’abo abakola mu Yeekaalu baliisibwa bya Yeekaalu, era nga n’abo abaweereza ku kyoto bagabana bya ku kyoto? <verse eid="1CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14"/>Mu ngeri y’emu Mukama waffe yalonda abo ababuulira Enjiri baliisibwenga olw’Enjiri.<verse eid="1CO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15"/>Kyokka nze siriiko na kimu ku ebyo kye nkozesezzaako. Era ssawandiika bino ndyoke binkolerwe kubanga waakiri nze okufa okusinga okwenyumiriza kwange bwe kutaabeemu nsa. <verse eid="1CO 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16"/>Kubanga bwe mbuulira Enjiri sisobola kwenyumiriza, kubanga mpalirizibwa okugibuulira. Era ziba zinsanze bwe sigibuulira. <verse eid="1CO 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17"/>Kubanga bwe mbuulira Enjiri olw’okweyagalira, mbeera n’empeera, naye ne bwe mba nga ssaagala, nkikola lwa kubanga nakwasibwa omulimu ogwo. <verse eid="1CO 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18"/>Kale empeera yange y’eruwa? Empeera yange kwe kubuulira Enjiri nga sisasulwa era nga sibasaba nsasulwe olw’omulimu ogwo nga bwe nsaanidde.<verse eid="1CO 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19"/>Kubanga newaakubadde nga ndi wa ddembe eri abantu bonna, nfuuka omuddu wa bonna olw’okweyagalira, ndyoke ndeete bangi eri Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20"/>Eri Abayudaaya nafuuka ng’Omuyudaaya ndyoke nsobole okubaleeta eri Kristo. N’eri abo abafugibwa amateeka nafuuka ng’afugibwa amateeka, newaakubadde nze nga ssifugibwa mateeka, ndyoke mbaleete eri Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21"/>Eri abo abatalina mateeka ga Katonda, nafuuka ng’atafugibwa mateeka, newaakubadde nga ssaaleka mateeka ga Katanda, naye nga ndi mu mateeka ga Kristo, n’abo abatalina mateeka ndyoke mbaleete eri Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22"/>Mu banafu nafuuka ng’omunafu ndyoke mbaleete eri Kristo. Eri abantu bonna nfuuse byonna, mu ngeri yonna ndyoke mbeeko beentusa ku kulokolebwa. <verse eid="1CO 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23"/>Byonna mbikola olw’enjiri, era nange ndyoke nfunire wamu nabo ebiva mu Njiri eyo.<verse eid="1CO 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24"/>Temumanyi nga mu mpaka ez’okudduka abo bonna abazeetabamu badduka, naye awangula ekirabo abeera omu? Kale nammwe muddukenga bwe mutyo nga mufubirira okuwangula ekirabo. <verse eid="1CO 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25"/>Buli muzanyi eyeetaba mu mpaka ateekwa okufuna okutendekebwa okw’amaanyi nga yeefuga mu bintu byonna. Ekyo bakikola balyoke bawangule engule eyonooneka. Naye ffe tulifuna engule eteyonooneka. <verse eid="1CO 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26"/>Noolwekyo nziruka nga nnina kye ŋŋenderera. Sirwana ng’omukubi w’ebikonde amala gawujja n’akuba ebbanga. <verse eid="1CO 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27"/>Naye mbonereza omubiri gwange ne ngufuula omuddu wange, si kulwa nga mbuulira abalala Enjiri, ate nze nzennyini ne sisiimibwa.<verse eid="1CO 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Okulabula ku Bakatonda Abalala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1"/>Abooluganda, musaana mutegeere nga bajjajjaffe bonna baakulemberwa ekire, era bonna ne bayita mu nnyanja, <verse eid="1CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2"/>bwe batyo bonna ne bakulemberwa Musa ne babatizibwa mu kire ne mu nnyanja. <verse eid="1CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3"/>Bonna baalyanga emmere y’emu ey’omwoyo, <verse eid="1CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4"/>era bonna baanywanga ekyokunywa kye kimu eky’omwoyo, kubanga bonna baanywanga mu lwazi olw’omwoyo olwabagobereranga era olwazi olwo yali Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5"/>Naye era abasinga obungi Katonda teyabasiima, bwe batyo ne bazikirizibwa mu ddungu.<verse eid="1CO 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6"/>Ebintu bino ebyabatuukako bitulabula obuteegomba bibi nga bo bwe baakola. <verse eid="1CO 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7"/>Temusinzanga bakatonda balala, ng’abamu ku bo bwe baali, ng’Ekyawandiikibwa bwe kigamba nti, “Abantu baatuula okulya n’okunywa ne basituka ne bakola effujjo.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8"/>Tetusaana kubeera benzi ng’abamu ku bo bwe baali, abantu emitwalo ebiri mu enkumi ssatu ku bo ne bafa mu lunaku lumu. <verse eid="1CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9"/>Era tetusaana kukema Kristo ng’abamu ku bo bwe baakola, emisota ne gibazikiriza. <verse eid="1CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10"/>Era temwemulugunyanga ng’abamu ku bo bwe baakola, ne battibwa omuzikiriza.<verse eid="1CO 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11"/>Ebyo byonna byabatuukako ng’ekyokulabirako gye tuli, era byawandiikibwa olw’okutulabula ffe abaliwo abatuukiddwako enkomerero. <verse eid="1CO 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12"/>Kale alowooza ng’ayimiridde, yeekuumenga aleme okugwa. <verse eid="1CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13"/>Tewali kukemebwa kubatuukako okutali kwa bantu; kyokka Katonda mwesigwa, kubanga taabalekenga kutuukibwako kukemebwa kwe mutayinza kugumira, naye anaabasobozesanga okubigumira, n’abalaga n’ekkubo ery’okubiwangula.<verse eid="1CO 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14"/>Noolwekyo, mikwano gyange, muddukenga okusinza bakatonda abalala. <verse eid="1CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15"/>Muli bantu abategeera. Kale, mulabe obanga kye njogera kye kikyo. <verse eid="1CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16"/>Ekikompe eky’omukisa, kye tusabira omukisa, si kwe kussekimu okw’omusaayi gwa Kristo? Omugaati gwe tumenya, si kwe kussekimu okw’omubiri gwa Kristo? <verse eid="1CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17"/>Kubanga ffe bangi, ffenna tulya ku mugaati gumu, ekiraga nga bwe tuli omubiri ogumu.<verse eid="1CO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18"/>Mulabe Isirayiri ow’omubiri, abalya ssaddaaka tebassa kimu na Kyoto? <verse eid="1CO 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19"/>Kale kiki kye ngezaako okutegeeza? Mulowooza ŋŋamba nti ebyokulya ebiweebwayo eri bakatonda abalala birimu amakulu? Oba nti bakatonda abalala balina omugaso? <verse eid="1CO 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20"/>Nedda. Kye ŋŋamba kye kino nti abo abawaayo ssaddaaka eri bakatonda abalala bawa eri baddayimooni so si eri Katonda. Saagala mwegatte wamu ne baddayimooni mussekimu nabo. <verse eid="1CO 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21"/>Temuyinza kunywa ku kikompe kya Mukama ate ne munywa ne ku kikompe kya baddayimooni. Era temuyinza kuliira ku mmeeza ya Mukama ate ne ku ya baddayimooni.<verse eid="1CO 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22"/>Oba Mukama tetumukwasa buggya? Tumusinza amaanyi? <verse eid="1CO 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23"/>Byonna bikkirizibwa, naye si byonna ebirimu omugaso. Byonna bikkirizibwa naye si byonna ebizimba. <verse eid="1CO 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24"/>Omuntu yenna alemenga okwefaako yekka, naye afengayo ne ku bya munne.<verse eid="1CO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25"/>Mwegulire ennyama eya buli ngeri gye batunda mu katale mulye, awatali kusooka kwebuuza olw’omwoyo gwammwe. <verse eid="1CO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26"/>Kubanga ensi ya Mukama n’okujjula kwayo.<verse eid="1CO 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27"/>Singa omu ku batali bakkiriza abayita ku kijjulo, ne mwagala okugenda, kale mulyenga kyonna kye banaabagabulanga nga temuliiko kye mubuuzizza olw’obulungi bw’omwoyo gwammwe. <verse eid="1CO 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28"/>Kyokka omuntu yenna bw’abategeezanga nti, “Kino kyaweereddwayo eri bakatonda abalala,” temukiryanga olw’oyo abategeezezza n’olw’obulungi bw’omwoyo gwammwe, <verse eid="1CO 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29"/>bwe njogera bwe ntyo, njogera ku mwoyo gwe so si ogw’oli omulala. Kubanga lwaki eddembe lyange lisalirwa omusango omwoyo gw’omulala? <verse eid="1CO 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30"/>Bwe ndya nga neebazizza, lwaki nnenyezebwa olw’ekyo kye ndya nga neebazizza?<verse eid="1CO 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31"/>Kubanga buli kye mukola, oba kulya oba kunywa, mukikole nga mugenderera kugulumiza Katonda. <verse eid="1CO 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32"/>Temukolanga ekyo ekineesittaza Abayudaaya oba Abayonaani wadde ab’ekkanisa ya Katonda. <verse eid="1CO 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33"/>Nange bwe ntyo ngezaako okusanyusa abantu bonna mu byonna bye nkola, nga sinoonya byange, wabula nga nfa ku bulungi bw’abalala balyoke balokolebwe.<verse eid="1CO 10:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1"/>Mundabireko nga nange bwe ndabira ku Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okubikka ku Mutwe mu Kusinza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2"/>Mbatenda nnyo Olw’okunzijjukiza mu bintu byonna era n’olw’okunyweza ebyo bye nabayigiriza. <verse eid="1CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3"/>Kyokka njagala mutegeere nti Kristo ye mutwe gwa buli muntu, n’omusajja gwe mutwe gwa mukazi we. Era Katonda ye mutwe gwa Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4"/>Noolwekyo omusajja yenna bw’asaba oba bw’ayogera eby’obunnabbi nga taggyeko kibikka ku mutwe gwe, aba aswaza omutwe gwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5"/>N’omukazi bw’asaba oba n’ayogera eby’obunnabbi nga tabisse mutwe gwe aba tawadde bba kitiibwa kubanga kyekimu n’oyo amwereddwako enviiri. <verse eid="1CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6"/>Obanga omukazi tayagala kubikka ku mutwe gwe, kale enviiri ze azisalengako. Naye obanga omukazi kimuswaza enviiri ze okuzisalako oba okuzimwako, kale ateekwa omutwe gwe okugubikkangako. <verse eid="1CO 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7"/>Omusajja tasaana kubikka ku mutwe gwe, kubanga ye kye kifaananyi n’ekitiibwa kya Katonda; naye omukazi ye ky’ekitiibwa ky’omusajja. <verse eid="1CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8"/>Kubanga omusajja teyatondebwa ng’aggibwa mu mukazi, wabula omukazi ow’olubereberye ye yaggyibwa mu musajja. <verse eid="1CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9"/>Era omusajja teyatondebwa lwa mukazi, wabula omukazi ye yatondebwa olw’omusajja. <verse eid="1CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10"/>Kale olw’ensonga eyo, omukazi kimusaanira okubikkanga ku mutwe gwe, okulaga nti afugibwa era ne bamalayika bakirabe. <verse eid="1CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11"/>Kyokka mu Mukama waffe, omukazi n’omusajja, buli omu yeetaaga munne. <verse eid="1CO 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12"/>Kuba, newaakubadde ng’omukazi ava mu musajja, naye buli musajja azaalibwa mukazi; kyokka byonna biva eri Katonda.<verse eid="1CO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13"/>Kale nammwe bennyini mwebuuze obanga kisaana omukazi okusaba Katonda nga tabisse ku mutwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14"/>Obuzaaliranwa tebubalaga ng’omusajja bw’aba n’enviiri empanvu tekimuweesa kitiibwa, <verse eid="1CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15"/>ate ng’omukazi ye zimuweesa kitiibwa? Kubanga yaweebwa enviiri empanvu okumubikkako. <verse eid="1CO 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16"/>Naye obanga waliwo ayagala okuwakanya bino, tetulinaayo nkola nga eyo, wadde mu Kkanisa za Katonda.<verse eid="1CO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekyekiro kya Mukama Waffe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17"/>Mu bino bye ŋŋenda okubalagira temuli kya kubatenda, kubanga enkuŋŋaana zammwe zivaamu bibi okusinga ebirungi. <verse eid="1CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18"/>Ekisooka bwe mukuŋŋaana ng’ekibiina, mwesalaasalamu ebitundu, era nzikiriza ng’ebimu ku ebyo bituufu. <verse eid="1CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19"/>Naye okwesalaasalamu okwo kusaana kubeewo abatuufu balyoke bategeerekeke. <verse eid="1CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20"/>Bwe mukuŋŋaana ekyo kye mulya si kye kyekiro kya Mukama waffe. <verse eid="1CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21"/>Kubanga bwe muba mulya buli omu alya ku lulwe, talinda banne. Abamu basigala bakyali bayala, ng’abalala bo batamidde.<verse eid="1CO 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22"/>Temulina wammwe gye muyinza okuliira n’okunywera? Oba munyooma ekkanisa ya Katonda, ne muswaza abaavu? Mbagambe ki? Mbatende olw’ekyo? Nedda na katono, sijja kubatenda. <verse eid="1CO 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23"/>Kubanga Mukama yennyini kye yampa ky’ekyo kye nabayigiriza nti, Mukama waffe Yesu, mu kiro kiri kye baamuliiramu olukwe, yaddira omugaati, <verse eid="1CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24"/>ne yeebaza Katonda, n’agumenyaamenyamu, n’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Guno mubiri gwange, oguweebwayo ku lwammwe, mugutoole mulye, mukolenga bwe mutyo okunzijukiranga.”</char> <verse eid="1CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25"/>Era mu ngeri y’emu bwe baamala okulya, yaddira ekikompe n’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Ekikompe kino y’endagaano empya ekoleddwa Katonda nammwe, ekakasiddwa n’omusaayi gwange, mutoole munywe, mukolenga bwe mutyo buli lwe munaakinywangako okunzijukiranga.”</char> <verse eid="1CO 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26"/>Kubanga buli lwe munaalyanga omugaati guno ne buli lwe munaanywanga ku kikompe, munaategeezanga abantu okufa kwa Mukama waffe okutuusa Lw’alijja.<verse eid="1CO 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27"/>Noolwekyo buli alya omugaati guno oba anywa ku kikompe kya Mukama waffe nga tasaanidde, azza omusango ku mubiri gwa Mukama waffe, ne ku musaayi gwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28"/>Noolwekyo omuntu amalenga kwekebera, alyoke alye ku mugaati n’okunywa ku kikompe. <verse eid="1CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29"/>Kubanga buli alya era anywa nga tafaayo kutegeera makulu ga mubiri gwa Mukama waffe, aba yeesalidde yekka omusango okumusinga. <verse eid="1CO 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30"/>Mu mmwe kyemuvudde mubaamu abanafu n’abalwadde, era bangi bafudde. <verse eid="1CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31"/>Naye singa tusooka okwekebera, tetwandisaliddwa musango kutusinga. <verse eid="1CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32"/>Kyokka Mukama bw’atusalira omusango aba atukangavvula tuleme kusalirwa musango awamu n’ensi. <verse eid="1CO 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33"/>Kale baganda bange, bwe mukuŋŋaananga awamu okulya, buli omu alinde munne. <verse eid="1CO 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34"/>Era singa wabaawo alumwa enjala amale okulya eka, bwe mukuŋŋaana muleme kwereetako musango. N’ebirala ndibirongoosa, we ndijjira wonna.<verse eid="1CO 11:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Ebirabo bya Mwoyo Mutukuvu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1"/>Abooluganda, ssaagala mmwe obutategeera ebikwata ku birabo ebya Mwoyo. <verse eid="1CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2"/>Mumanyi nti bwe mwali Abaamawanga mwabuzibwabuzibwanga ne mutwalibwa eri ebifaananyi ebitayogera. <verse eid="1CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3"/>Noolwekyo njagala mutegeere nti tewali muntu aba ne Mwoyo wa Katonda n’ayogera nti, “Yesu akolimirwe.” Era tewali n’omu asobola okwogera nti, “Yesu ye Mukama waffe,” wabula ku bwa Mwoyo Mutukuvu.<verse eid="1CO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4"/>Waliwo ebirabo bya ngeri nnyingi, naye Mwoyo abigaba y’omu. <verse eid="1CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5"/>Waliwo engeri nnyingi ez’okuweererezaamu, naye Mukama aweerezebwa y’omu. <verse eid="1CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6"/>Waliwo okukola kwa ngeri nnyingi kyokka Katonda asobozesa bonna mu byonna bye bakola y’omu.<verse eid="1CO 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7"/>Mwoyo Mutukuvu yeeragira mu buli omu olw’okugasa bonna. <verse eid="1CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8"/>Omu Omwoyo amuwa okwogera ekigambo eky’amagezi, omulala Omwoyo oyo omu n’amuwa okuyiga n’ategeera. <verse eid="1CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9"/>Omulala Omwoyo y’omu n’amuwa okukkiriza, n’omulala n’amuwa obuyinza okuwonyanga abalwadde. <verse eid="1CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10"/>Omu, Omwoyo amuwa okukolanga ebyamagero, n’omulala n’amuwa okwogera eby’obunnabbi, ate omulala n’amuwa okwawulanga emyoyo emirungi n’emibi. Omulala amuwa okwogera ennimi ezitali zimu, n’omulala n’amuwa okuzivvuunula. <verse eid="1CO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11"/>Naye Omwoyo akola ebyo byonna y’omu, y’agabira buli muntu ng’Omwoyo oyo bw’ayagala.<verse eid="1CO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omubiri Guli Gumu naye Ebitundu byagwo Bingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12"/>Kuba omubiri nga bwe guli ogumu, ne guba n’ebitundu bingi, ate ebitundu byonna ne byegatta ne biba omubiri gumu, kale, ne Kristo bw’ali bw’atyo. <verse eid="1CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13"/>Bwe tutyo ffenna twabatizibwa mu Mwoyo omu, ne tufuuka omubiri gumu, oba Bayudaaya, oba baamawanga, oba baddu, oba ba ddembe, era ne tunywa ku Mwoyo oyo omu.<verse eid="1CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14"/>Kubanga omubiri tegulina kitundu kimu, naye gulina ebitundu bingi. <verse eid="1CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15"/>Singa ekigere kigamba nti, “Nze siri mukono, noolwekyo siri kitundu kya mubiri,” ekyo tekikifuula butaba kitundu kya mubiri. <verse eid="1CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16"/>Era singa okutu kugamba nti, “Siri liiso, noolwekyo siri kitundu kya mubiri,” ekyo kikiggyako okubeera ekitundu ky’omubiri? <verse eid="1CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17"/>Kale singa omubiri gwonna gwali liiso, olwo okuwulira kwandibadde wa? Era singa omubiri gwonna gwali kutu, olwo okuwunyiriza kwandibadde wa? <verse eid="1CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18"/>Naye kaakano Katonda yakola ebitundu bingi eby’enjawulo n’alyoka abifuula omubiri gwaffe nga bwe yayagala. <verse eid="1CO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19"/>Singa byonna byali ekitundu kimu olwo omubiri gwandibadde wa? <verse eid="1CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20"/>Naye kaakano ebitundu bingi naye ng’omubiri guli gumu.<verse eid="1CO 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21"/>Eriiso terisobola kugamba mukono nti, “Ggwe sikwetaaga,” oba n’omutwe teguyinza kugamba bigere nti, “Mmwe sibeetaaga.” <verse eid="1CO 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22"/>Era ebitundu ebyo eby’omubiri ebirabika ng’ebisinga obunafu bye byetaagibwa ennyo. <verse eid="1CO 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23"/>Era n’ebitundu ebyo eby’omubiri bye tulowooza obutaba bya kitiibwa bye bisinga okwambazibwa, n’ebitundu ebitukwasa ensonyi bye tusinga okulabirira, <verse eid="1CO 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24"/>so ng’ebitundu byaffe ebisinga okwolekebwa mu bantu tebikyetaaga. Bw’atyo Katonda bwe yakola omubiri, ebitundu ebyandibadde biragajjalirwa n’abyongera ekitiibwa, <verse eid="1CO 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25"/>olwo omubiri ne guteeyawulamu naye ebitundu byonna, ne biyambagana byokka ne byokka. <verse eid="1CO 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26"/>Ekitundu ekimu bwe kirumwa, ebitundu ebirala byonna birumirwa. Era ekitundu ekimu bwe kigulumizibwa, ebitundu byonna bijaguliza wamu nakyo.<verse eid="1CO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27"/>Kale mwenna awamu muli mubiri gwa Kristo, era buli omu ku mmwe kitundu kyagwo. <verse eid="1CO 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28"/>Era abamu Katonda yabateekawo mu kkanisa: abasooka be batume, abookubiri be bannabbi, n’abookusatu be bayigiriza, ne kuddako abakola eby’amagero, ne kuddako abalina ebirabo eby’okuwonya endwadde, n’okuyamba abali mu kwetaaga, abakulembeze, era n’aboogezi b’ennimi. <verse eid="1CO 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29"/>Bonna batume? Bonna bannabbi? Bonna bayigiriza? Bonna bakola ebyamagero? <verse eid="1CO 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30"/>Bonna balina ekirabo ky’okuwonya endwadde? Bonna boogera mu nnimi? Bonna bavvuunula ennimi? <verse eid="1CO 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31"/>Kale mwegombenga ebirabo ebisinga obukulu, naye ka mbalage ekkubo eddungi erisinga gonna.<verse eid="1CO 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Okwagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1"/>Singa njogera ennimi z’abantu n’eza bamalayika, naye nga sirina kwagala, mba ng’ekidde, ekireekaana oba ng’ekitaasa ekisaala. <verse eid="1CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2"/>Ne bwe mba n’ekirabo eky’okwogera eby’obunnabbi, ne ntegeera ebyama byonna, era ne mmanya ebintu byonna, era ne bwe mba n’okukkiriza okungi ne kunsobozesa n’okusiguukulula ensozi, naye nga sirina kwagala, mba siri kintu. <verse eid="1CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3"/>Ne bwe mpaayo ebyange byonna okuyamba abaavu, era ne bwe mpaayo omubiri gwange ne nneewaana, naye ne siba na kwagala, sibaako kye ngasibbwa.<verse eid="1CO 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4"/>Okwagala kugumiikiriza era kwa kisa. Okwagala tekulina buggya era tekwenyumiikiriza wadde okwekuluntaza. <verse eid="1CO 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5"/>Okwagala tekukola bitasaana, tekunoonya byakwo, tekunyiiga mangu, era tekusiba kibi ku mwoyo. <verse eid="1CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6"/>Okwagala tekusanyukira bitali bya butuukirivu, wabula kusanyukira mazima. <verse eid="1CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7"/>Okwagala kugumira byonna, kukkiriza byonna, kusuubira byonna era kugumiikiriza byonna.<verse eid="1CO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8"/>Okwagala tekulemererwa; obunnabbi buliggyibwawo, n’ennimi zirikoma, n’eby’amagezi birikoma. <verse eid="1CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9"/>Kubanga tumanyiiko kitundu, ne bunnabbi nabwo bwa kitundu. <verse eid="1CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10"/>Naye ebituukiridde bwe birijja, olwo eby’ekitundu nga biggwaawo. <verse eid="1CO 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11"/>Bwe nnali omuto, nayogeranga ng’omuto, nalowoozanga ng’omuto, ne byonna nga mbiraba mu ngeri ya kito. Naye bwe nakula ne ndeka eby’ekito. <verse eid="1CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12"/>Kaakano tulaba kifaananyi bufaananyi, ng’abali mu ndabirwamu eteraba bulungi; naye tulirabira ddala bulungi amaaso n’amaaso. Kaakano mmanyiiko kitundu butundu, naye luli ndimanyira ddala byonna, mu bujjuvu.<verse eid="1CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13"/>Kaakano waliwo ebintu bisatu eby’olubeerera: okukkiriza, n’okusuubira, era n’okwagala. Naye ekisingako ku ebyo obukulu kwe kwagala.<verse eid="1CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Ebirabo eby’Omwoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1"/>Mugobererenga okwagala era muluubirirenga ebirabo eby’Omwoyo, na ddala ekirabo eky’okwogera eby’obunnabbi. <verse eid="1CO 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2"/>Kubanga ayogera mu nnimi tayogera n’abantu, wabula ayogera na Katonda. Kubanga tewali n’omu ategeera by’agamba. Aba ayogera bya kyama mu Mwoyo. <verse eid="1CO 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3"/>Naye oyo ategeeza abantu eby’obunnabbi ayogera ebibazimba, ebibagumya era n’okubazzaamu amaanyi. <verse eid="1CO 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4"/>Ayogera ennimi yeezimba yekka, naye oyo ayogera eby’obunnabbi azimba ekibiina kyonna eky’abakkiriza. <verse eid="1CO 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5"/>Nandyagadde mwenna mwogere mu nnimi, naye ekisingira ddala nandyagadde mwenna mwogere eby’obunnabbi, kubanga ayogera eby’obunnabbi akira oyo ayogera mu nnimi, okuggyako nga waliwo avvuunula, Ekkanisa eryoke egasibwe.<verse eid="1CO 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6"/>Kale kaakano, abooluganda, bwe nzija gye muli ne njogera mu nnimi mbagasa ntya? Naye bwe mbategeeza ebyo Katonda by’ambikulidde oba bye njize mu kutegeera, oba eby’obunnabbi, oba bye njigiriza, olwo mmanyi nga mbagasa. <verse eid="1CO 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7"/>Era n’ebivuga ebitalina bulamu, ng’endere oba ennanga, bwe bitavuga mu maloboozi gategeerekeka, omuntu ayinza atya okutegeera oluyimba olufuuyibwa oba olukubibwa? <verse eid="1CO 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8"/>Era singa omufuuyi w’eŋŋombe tafuuwa ddoboozi Iitegeerekeka, ani ayinza okweteekerateekera olutalo? <verse eid="1CO 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9"/>Mu ngeri y’emu, bwe mwogera n’omuntu mu lulimi lw’atamanyi, asobola atya okutegeera kye mugamba? Muba mwogeredde bwereere. <verse eid="1CO 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10"/>Weewaawo waliwo ennimi nnyingi mu nsi, era zonna zirina amakulu. <verse eid="1CO 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11"/>Naye omuntu bw’ayogera olulimi lwe simanyi, aba ng’omugwira gye ndi, nange mba ng’omugwira gy’ali. <verse eid="1CO 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12"/>Bwe mutyo nga bwe mwegomba okufuna ebirabo eby’Omwoyo, mufubenga nnyo mulyoke musobole okuzimba Ekkanisa ya Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13"/>Kale buli ayogera mu lulimi asabe Katonda amusobozese okuluvvuunula. <verse eid="1CO 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14"/>Kubanga bwe nsaba Katonda mu lulimi lwe sitegeera, omwoyo gwange gusaba, naye sibaako kye nganyulwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15"/>Kale kino ki? Nnaasinzanga Katonda n’omwoyo gwange awamu n’amagezi gange era nnaayimbanga mu mwoyo gwange awamu n’amagezi gange. <verse eid="1CO 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16"/>Kubanga bw’otendereza Katonda mu mwoyo gwo, omuntu atategeera ky’ogamba ayinza atya okuddamu nti, “Amiina!” ng’omaliriza okwebaza, ng’ebigambo ebyebazizza tabitegedde? <verse eid="1CO 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17"/>Weewaawo oyinza okuba nga weebazizza Katonda, naye omulala nga tagasibbwa.<verse eid="1CO 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18"/>Neebaza Katonda kubanga njogera ennimi okubasinga mwenna. <verse eid="1CO 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19"/>Naye mu lukuŋŋaana njagala njogere n’amagezi gange ebigambo bitaano abalala bye bategeera nga mbayigiriza, okusinga okwogera ebigambo omutwalo mu nnimi, bye bataategeere.<verse eid="1CO 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20"/>Abooluganda, temulowooza bya kito. Mube ng’abaana abato ku bikwata ku kukola ebibi, mube bakulu mu kulowooza kwammwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21"/>Era kyawandiikibwa mu mateeka nti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">“Ndyogera n’abantu bano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">mu nnimi endala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">n’emimwa egy’abalala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">naye era tebalimpulira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">bw’ayogera Mukama.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22"/>Noolwekyo ennimi kyeziva ziba akabonero, si eri abo abakkiriza naye eri abo abatali bakkiriza, naye okutegeeza obunnabbi kw’abo abakkiriza so si abo abatali bakkiriza. <verse eid="1CO 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23"/>Kale singa Ekkanisa ekuŋŋaana bonna ne boogera mu nnimi abatamanyi oba abatali bakkiriza ne bayingira, tebagamba nti mulaluse? <verse eid="1CO 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24"/>Naye singa bonna boogera eby’obunnabbi, atali mukkiriza oba atamanyi n’ayingira, ebyo ebyogerebwa byonna, bijja kumuleetera okulumirizibwa olw’ebibi bye, yeesalire omusango, <verse eid="1CO 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25"/>ebyama by’omu mutima gwe bibikkulwe, alyoke afukamire asinze Katonda, nga bw’agamba nti, “Ddala Katonda ali mu mmwe.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Byonna Bikolebwe mu Bulambulukufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26"/>Kale abooluganda tugambe tutya? Bwe mukuŋŋaana buli omu aba ne zabbuli, oba eky’okuyigiriza, oba ekyo Katonda ky’amubikkulidde, oba okwogera mu nnimi, oba okuvvuunula. Ebyo byonna bisaana bikolebwe olw’okuzimba Ekkanisa ya Katonda. <verse eid="1CO 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27"/>Singa wabaawo aboogera mu nnimi bandyogedde babiri, oba obutasussa basatu, era nga boogera mu mpalo, ate wabeewo n’avvuunula. <verse eid="1CO 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28"/>Naye bwe watabaawo avvuunula omwogezi w’ennimi asirike busirisi mu Kkanisa wabula ayogerere munda ye ne Katonda.<verse eid="1CO 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29"/>Kyokka abo aboogera eby’obunnabbi boogerenga babiri oba basatu, ng’abalala bafumiitiriza ku ebyo ebyogerwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30"/>Naye singa omu ku batudde abikkulirwa ekigambo kya Katonda, oyo abadde ayogera asirikenga. <verse eid="1CO 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31"/>Kubanga mwenna musobola okwogera eby’obunnabbi nga mwogera mu mpalo, bonna balyoke bayige era bongerwemu amaanyi. <verse eid="1CO 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32"/>Abalina omwoyo ogw’obunnabbi bafugibwa bannabbi, <verse eid="1CO 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33"/>kubanga Katonda si wa luyoogaano, wabula wa mirembe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Kale nga bwe kiri mu Kkanisa z’abatukuvu zonna, <verse eid="1CO 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34"/>abakazi basirikenga busirisi mu kuŋŋaaniro, kubanga tebakkirizibwa kwogera, wabula okukulemberwa ng’amateeka bwe gagamba. <verse eid="1CO 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35"/>Bwe wabangawo kye baagala okubuuza babuuzenga ba bbaabwe eka, kubanga kya nsonyi omukazi okwogera mu Kkanisa.<verse eid="1CO 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36"/>Kale mulowooza nti ekigambo kya Katonda kyatandikira mu mmwe oba nti mmwe be kyatuukako mwekka? <verse eid="1CO 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37"/>Omuntu yenna alowooza okuba nnabbi oba omuntu ow’omwoyo, ategeere mu bujjuvu nti bino bye mbawandiikira kye kiragiro kya Mukama. <verse eid="1CO 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38"/>Naye omuntu yenna atabifaako naye si wa kufiibwako.<verse eid="1CO 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39"/>Kale baganda bange muyaayaanirenga okwogera eby’obunnabbi, kyokka okwogera mu nnimi temukuziyiza. <verse eid="1CO 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40"/>Naye byonna bikolebwenga nga bwe kisaana era mu ntegeka entuufu.<verse eid="1CO 14:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Kristo Yazuukira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1"/>Abooluganda, mbajjukiza Enjiri gye nababuulira era gye mwakkiriza era gye munywereddemu. <verse eid="1CO 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2"/>Mulokolebwa lwa Njiri eyo gye nababuulira, bwe muginywererako, naye bwe kitaba bwe kityo muba mwakkiririza bwereere. <verse eid="1CO 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3"/>Kubanga nabategeeza ekigambo ekikulu ennyo nange kye nnaweebwa ekigamba nti Kristo yafa olw’ebibi byaffe, ng’Ebyawandiikibwa bwe bigamba, <verse eid="1CO 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4"/>era nti yaziikibwa, n’azuukizibwa ku lunaku olwokusatu ng’Ebyawandiikibwa bwe bigamba, <verse eid="1CO 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5"/>era nti yalabibwa Keefa n’oluvannyuma ekkumi n’ababiri. <verse eid="1CO 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6"/>Era yalabibwa abooluganda abasukka ebikumi ebitaano omulundi gumu era abamu ku abo bakyali balamu newaakubadde ng’abalala baafa. <verse eid="1CO 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7"/>Olwo n’alyoka alabikira Yakobo, n’oluvannyuma n’alabikira n’abatume bonna. <verse eid="1CO 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8"/>Oluvannyuma lwa bonna n’alyoka alabikira nange, ng’omwana azaalibbwa nga musowole.<verse eid="1CO 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9"/>Kubanga nze nsembayo mu batume, Era sisaanira na kuyitibwa mutume, kubanga nayigganya Ekkanisa ya Katonda. <verse eid="1CO 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10"/>Naye olw’ekisa kya Katonda ndi nga bwe ndi kaakano, era ekisa Katonda kye yankwatirwa tekyafa bwereere. Kubanga nakola nnyo okusinga abalala bonna, naye si nze nakola wabula ekisa kya Katonda ekiri nange kye kyakola. <verse eid="1CO 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11"/>Oba nze oba bo, be baakola ennyo ekyo si kikulu, ekikulu kye kino nti twababuulira Enjiri era nammwe ne mugikkiriza.<verse eid="1CO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzuukira kw’Abafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12"/>Kale obanga abantu bategeezebwa nti Kristo yazuukizibwa mu bafu lwaki abamu mu mmwe bagamba nti tewali kuzuukira kwa bafu? <verse eid="1CO 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13"/>Kale obanga tewali kuzuukira kwa bafu ne Kristo teyazuukizibwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14"/>Era obanga Kristo teyazuukizibwa, bye tubategeeza tebiriimu, era n’okukkiriza kwammwe tekuliiko kye kugasa. <verse eid="1CO 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15"/>Ate era tuba ng’aboogera eby’obulimba ku Katonda, kubanga twakakasa nti Katonda yazuukiza Kristo. Naye teyamuzuukiza bwe kiba ng’abafu tebazuukizibwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16"/>Kale obanga abafu tebazuukizibwa, ne Kristo teyazuukizibwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17"/>Era obanga Kristo teyazuukizibwa okukkiriza kwammwe tekuliimu nsa, era mukyali mu bibi byammwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18"/>Era n’abo abaafa nga bakkiriza Kristo baazikirira. <verse eid="1CO 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19"/>Kale obanga essuubi lyaffe mu Kristo likoma mu bulamu buno bwokka, tuli bakusaasirwa nnyo okusinga abantu bonna.<verse eid="1CO 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20"/>Kyokka ddala Kristo yazuukizibwa mu bafu, era bye bibala ebibereberye eby’abo abaafa. <verse eid="1CO 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21"/>Kuba ng’okufa bwe kwaleetebwa omuntu, era n’okuzuukira kw’abafu kwaleetebwa muntu. <verse eid="1CO 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22"/>Kuba ng’abantu bonna bwe baafa olwa Adamu, era bwe batyo bonna balifuulibwa abalamu olwa Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23"/>Kyokka buli omu mu luwalo lwe, Kristo ye yasooka era bw’alijja ababe ne baddako, <verse eid="1CO 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24"/>olwo enkomerero n’eryoka etuuka, Kristo n’akwasa Katonda Kitaawe obwakabaka; Kristo ng’amaze okuzikiriza obufuzi bwonna, n’obuyinza bwonna era n’amaanyi gonna. <verse eid="1CO 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25"/>Kubanga Kristo agwanidde okufuga okutuusa bw’alissa abalabe be bonna wansi w’ebigere bye. <verse eid="1CO 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26"/>Omulabe we alisembayo okuzikirizibwa kwe Kufa. <verse eid="1CO 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27"/>Kubanga yassa ebintu byonna wansi w’ebigere bye. Naye bw’agamba nti ebintu byonna biri wansi we, kitegeeza nti aggyeko oli ey’amusobozesa okufuga ebintu byonna. <verse eid="1CO 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28"/>Katonda bw’alimala okussa byonna mu buyinza bwa Kristo, olwo Kristo yennyini, Omwana we, n’alyoka afugibwa Katonda eyamuwa okufuga byonna. Era olwo Katonda n’alyoka afugira ddala byonna.<verse eid="1CO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29"/>Kale obanga abafu tebazuukizibwa, abo ababatizibwa ku lw’abafu balikola batya? Era kale lwaki babatizibwa ku lwabwe? <verse eid="1CO 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30"/>Era ffe lwaki tuli mu kabi buli kaseera? <verse eid="1CO 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31"/>Abooluganda, olw’okwenyumiriza kwe munninamu, era kwe nnina mu Kristo Yesu Mukama waffe, nkakasa nti nfa buli lunaku. <verse eid="1CO 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32"/>Kale obanga nze omuntu obuntu nalwana n’ensolo enkambwe mu Efeso, kingasa ki? Obanga abafu tebazuukizibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:32">“Kale tulye tunywe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:32">kubanga enkya tuli ba kufa.”<verse eid="1CO 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33"/>Temulimbibwalimbibwanga, kubanga “emikwano emibi gyonoona empisa ennungi.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34"/>Mweddemu, mutambulirenga mu butuukirivu mulekeraawo okukola ebibi, kubanga abamu mu mmwe tebamanyi Katonda. Kino nkyogera kubakwasa nsonyi.<verse eid="1CO 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzuukira kw’Omubiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35"/>Naye omuntu ayinza okubuuza nti, “Abafu bazuukizibwa batya?” Era nti, mubiri gwa ngeri ki gwe bajja nagwo? <verse eid="1CO 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36"/>Musirusiru ggwe! Ensigo gy’osiga temeruka nga tennafa. <verse eid="1CO 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37"/>Era ensigo eyo gy’osiga eba mpeke buweke; so si ekirivaamu oba ya ŋŋaano, oba ya ngeri ndala. <verse eid="1CO 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38"/>Naye Katonda agiwa omubiri nga bw’ayagala, era buli ngeri ya nsigo agiwa omubiri gwayo. <verse eid="1CO 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39"/>Kubanga emibiri gyonna tegiba gya ngeri emu. Waliwo omubiri ogw’abantu, waliwo ogw’ensolo, waliwo ogw’ennyonyi, era waliwo n’ogw’ebyennyanja. <verse eid="1CO 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40"/>Noolwekyo waliwo emibiri egy’omu ggulu, n’emibiri egy’omu nsi. Naye ekitiibwa ky’emibiri egy’omu ggulu kirala, era n’eky’egy’omu nsi kirala. <verse eid="1CO 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41"/>Waliwo ekitiibwa ky’enjuba, waliwo eky’omwezi, era waliwo ekitiibwa eky’emmunyeenye. Naye era n’emmunyeenye tezenkanankana mu kwaka kubanga buli munyeenye ya njawulo mu kwaka.<verse eid="1CO 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42"/>Era bwe kiri mu kuzuukira. Omubiri guziikibwa nga gwa kuvunda, ne guzuukizibwa nga si gwa kuvunda. <verse eid="1CO 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43"/>Guziikibwa nga si gwa kitiibwa, naye ne guzuukizibwa nga gujjudde ekitiibwa. Guziikibwa nga munafu, naye guzuukizibwa nga gwa maanyi. <verse eid="1CO 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44"/>Guziikibwa nga mubiri bubiri, naye guzuukizibwa nga mubiri gwa mwoyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 15:44">Kale obanga waliwo omubiri obubiri, era waliwo omubiri ogw’omwoyo, <verse eid="1CO 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45"/>kyekyava kiwandiikibwa nti, “Adamu, omuntu eyasooka, yatondebwa ng’alina obulamu.” Kyokka Adamu ow’oluvannyuma ye Mwoyo aleeta obulamu. <verse eid="1CO 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46"/>Naye eky’omwoyo si kye kyasooka, wabula eky’omubiri obubiri kye kyasooka, n’oluvannyuma eky’omwoyo ne kijja. <verse eid="1CO 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47"/>Omuntu eyasooka yava mu ttaka, yakolebwa mu nfuufu. Ye omuntu owookubiri yava mu ggulu. <verse eid="1CO 15:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48"/>Ng’eyakolebwa mu nfuufu bw’ali, n’abo abaakolebwa mu nfuufu bwe bali. <verse eid="1CO 15:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49"/>Era nga bwe tufaanana oyo eyakolebwa mu nfuufu, era bwe tutyo bwe tulifaanana oyo eyava mu ggulu.<verse eid="1CO 15:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50"/>Abooluganda, kye ŋŋamba kye kino nti omubiri guno ogw’oku nsi, ogw’ennyama n’omusaayi, teguyinza kusikira bwakabaka bwa Katonda. Emibiri gyaffe egivunda tegisobola kuba gya lubeerera. <verse eid="1CO 15:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51"/>Naye leka mbabuulire ekyama: Si ffenna abalifa, naye eŋŋombe ey’enkomerero bw’erivuga ffenna tulifuusibwa <verse eid="1CO 15:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52"/>mu kaseera katono ng’okutemya kikowe. Kubanga eŋŋombe erivuga, n’abafu balizuukizibwa, nga tebakyaddayo kufa era ffenna tulifuusibwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53"/>Kubanga omubiri guno oguvunda gwa kufuuka ogutavunda, era omubiri guno ogufa gwa kufuuka ogutafa. <verse eid="1CO 15:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54"/>Omubiri guno oguvunda bwe gulifuuka ogutavunda, ogufa ne gufuuka ogutafa, olwo Ekyawandiikibwa ne kiryoka kituukirira ekigamba nti, “Okufa kuwanguddwa.”<verse eid="1CO 15:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55"/>“Ggwe kufa, obuwanguzi bwo buluwa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:55">Ggwe kufa, amaanyi go agalumya galuwa?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56"/>Obuyinza obulumya buva mu kibi, n’amaanyi g’ekibi gava mu mateeka. <verse eid="1CO 15:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57"/>Kyokka Katonda yeebazibwe atuwanguza ffe ku bwa Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="1CO 15:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58"/>Noolwekyo, baganda bange abaagalwa, mubenga banywevu era abatasagaasagana nga mweyongeranga bulijjo okukola omulimu gwa Mukama waffe, kubanga mumanyi nti okufuba kwammwe si kwa bwereere mu Mukama waffe.<verse eid="1CO 15:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuyamba Abantu ba Katonda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1"/>Kale ebyo ebikwata ku kuyamba abantu ba Katonda, mmwe mukole nga bwe nagamba ab’Ekkanisa z’e Ggalatiya. <verse eid="1CO 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2"/>Buli omu ku mmwe ng’asinziira ku kufuna kwe mu wiiki, abengako ky’atereka, ebintu bireme kukuŋŋaanyizibwa nga nzize. <verse eid="1CO 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3"/>Kale bwe ndituuka ne mutuma abo be munaasiima ne mbawa ebbaluwa ne batwala ebirabo byammwe e Yerusaalemi. <verse eid="1CO 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4"/>Naye bwe kirirabika nga nange nsaanye ŋŋende, kale balimperekerako.<verse eid="1CO 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Enteekateeka za Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5"/>Ŋŋenda kujja gye muli nga mpitira e Makedoniya, gye ndimala akabanga akatono. <verse eid="1CO 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6"/>Osanga ewammwe gye ndimala ebbanga eriwera, oboolyawo ndiba nammwe mu biseera eby’obutiti byonna, mulyoke munnyambe buli gye nnaalaganga. <verse eid="1CO 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7"/>Saagala kubalabako kaseera katono, nsuubira okumala nammwe ekiseera, Mukama waffe bw’alisiima. <verse eid="1CO 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8"/>Kyokka ŋŋenda kubeera mu Efeso okutuusa ku Pentekoote. <verse eid="1CO 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9"/>Kubanga ddala oluggi lw’Enjiri lunziguliddwawo, newaakubadde ng’eriyo bangi abampakanya.<verse eid="1CO 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10"/>Timoseewo bw’ajjanga, mumuyambe atereere bulungi mu mmwe, kubanga naye akola omulimu gwa Mukama waffe nga nze. <verse eid="1CO 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11"/>Noolwekyo waleme kubaawo amunyooma. Mumuyambe olugendo lwe lube lwa mirembe, ajje gye ndi. Kubanga nze n’abooluganda tumulindiridde.<verse eid="1CO 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12"/>Naye ebyo ebikwata ku wooluganda Apolo, namwegayirira nnyo ajje gye muli, ng’ali n’abooluganda abalala, kyokka ye n’atayagala kujja kaakano, wabula alijja ng’afunye ebbanga.<verse eid="1CO 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebikomererayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13"/>Mutunulenga, munywerere mu kukkiriza, mubeere bazira era ab’amaanyi. <verse eid="1CO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14"/>Buli kye mukola mukikolerenga mu kwagala.<verse eid="1CO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15"/>Abooluganda, mumanyi nti mu Akaya ab’omu nnyumba ya Suteefana be baasooka okukkiriza Mukama waffe, era beewaayo okuyamba n’okuweereza abantu ba Katonda. Kale, abooluganda, mbasaba <verse eid="1CO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16"/>muwulirenga abantu ng’abo, era na buli omu afube okukoleranga awamu nabo. <verse eid="1CO 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17"/>Suteefana ne Folutunaato ne Akayiko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Suteefana ne Folutunaato ne Akayiko bandiba nga be baaleetera Pawulo ebbaluwa eyava mu Bakkolinso</char></note> bwe bajja gye ndi nasanyuka, kubanga baaliwo mu kifo kyammwe. <verse eid="1CO 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18"/>Era bansanyusa, era nga nammwe bwe baabasanyusa. Abantu ng’abo musaana mubalage nga bwe musiimye okuweereza kwabwe.<verse eid="1CO 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19"/>Ekkanisa ey’omu Asiya ebalamusizza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:19">Akula ne Pulisikira awamu n’Ekkanisa ya Kristo eri mu maka gaabwe babalamusizza nnyo mu Mukama waffe.<verse eid="1CO 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20"/>Era abooluganda bonna babalamusizza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:20">Mulamusagane mu n’okunywegera okutukuvu.<verse eid="1CO 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21"/>Nze, Pawulo, mbaweereza okulamusa kwange kuno, kwe mpandiika nze nzennyini n’omukono gwange.<verse eid="1CO 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22"/>Obanga waliwo atayagala Mukama, akolimirwe. Mukama waffe Yesu, jjangu!<verse eid="1CO 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23"/>Ekisa kya Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo kibeerenga nammwe.<verse eid="1CO 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24"/>Mwenna mbalamusizza n’okwagala mu Kristo Yesu. Amiina.<verse eid="1CO 16:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16"/>
</usx>
